sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Backend Spring Boot
    participant AI as AI Service FastAPI
    participant M as Modelos/fallbacks
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant L as API LLM opcional

    B->>AI: POST /internal/v1/transactions/classify
    AI->>M: predict(items)
    M-->>AI: categoria, subcategoria, confiança
    AI-->>B: versão, status e predictions

    B->>AI: POST /internal/v1/profiles/analyze
    AI->>M: predict(features) ou regras
    M-->>AI: perfil, score, confiança, fatores
    AI-->>B: ProfileAnalyzeResponse

    B->>AI: POST /internal/v1/agent/respond/stream
    par ferramentas
        AI->>AI: executa ferramentas sobre AgentContext
    and retrieval
        AI->>DB: busca vetorial/full-text por usuário/origem
    end
    opt LLM habilitada e chave configurada
        AI->>L: POST /chat/completions stream=true
        L-->>AI: deltas
    end
    AI-->>B: SSE tools, sources, token e done
